# Vulnerabilities accepted in Qualor's own Trivy scan of this repository (the dogfood self-scan and
# the CI scan job), each with the reason and a review date: `exp:` makes Trivy report it again from
# that day. The scanner images keep their own list in deploy/scanner/.trivyignore.yaml.

# golang.org/x/crypto/openpgp is deprecated and unmaintained; there is no fixed version. Listed by
# tools/analyzers/go-tools/gosec/go.mod (the gosec build module of qualor/scanner): gosec links
# x/crypto's chacha20poly1305, cryptobyte and hkdf, never openpgp.
GO-2026-5932 exp:2026-12-31
